  "description": "Mixed conditionals соединяют unreal condition и result из разных временных периодов.",
  "theory": {
    "rule_id": "RULE-B2-16-RU",
    "lesson_num": 16,
    "title": "Правила: Mixed conditionals: If I were you, I wouldn't have done it",
    "level": "B2",
    "overview": "Mixed conditionals соединяют unreal condition и result из разных временных периодов.",
    "main_rule": "Past condition → present result: If + Past Perfect, would + V1/state now. Present condition → past result: If + Past, would have + V3.",
    "form": "Past→present: If + had + V3, would + V1. Present→past: If + V2, would have + V3.",
    "when_why": "Сначала выясни, когда существует imaginary cause и когда imaginary result.",
    "examples": "If I had taken that job, I would live abroad now. → Если бы я тогда взял ту работу, сейчас я бы жил за границей.\nIf I were more organised, I wouldn't have missed the deadline yesterday. → Если бы я был более организованным, я бы вчера не пропустил deadline.",
    "special_cases": "Не выбирай pattern только по memorized formula. Определи two time periods.",
    "common_mistakes": "❌ If I had taken the job, I would have lived abroad now. → Для past cause + present result обычно: I would live abroad now.\n❌ If I were more organised, I wouldn't miss the deadline yesterday. → Past result: wouldn't have missed.",
    "dont_confuse": "Cause и result могут относиться к разным временам.",
    "quick_summary": "Past cause → present result.\nPresent condition → past result.\nСначала время, потом форма."
  },
